  "statuteText": "207:62 Operation Game Thief; Fund Account Established. –\n\nThe state treasurer shall establish a separate nonlapsing account within the fish and game fund to be known as the operation game thief account to which moneys obtained by the fish and game department shall be applied, including any federal moneys which become available and all donations received for such purpose. The moneys in this account including accrued interest, shall be used exclusively for, and shall be continually appropriated to, the administration and participation in Operation Game Thief."
